{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"20514","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/20514","key":"MC-275377","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"15/Aug/24 8:56 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p><b>Steps to reproduce</b>:</p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Build the following setup in a world with the Minecart Improvements experiment enabled:<br>\n<span class=\"image-wrap\" style=\"\"><a id=\"36959_thumb\" href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/36959\" title=\"Setup.png\" file-preview-type=\"image\" file-preview-id=\"36959\" file-preview-title=\"Setup.png\"><jira-attachment-thumbnail url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/36959?default=false\" jira-url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/36959\" filename=\"Setup.png\"><img src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/36959\" data-attachment-name=\"Setup.png\" data-attachment-type=\"thumbnail\" data-media-services-id=\"65eb914f-a9cd-4e76-aeb6-99fcfc6f85af\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" style=\"border: 0px solid black\"></jira-attachment-thumbnail></a></span></li>\n\t<li>Push the minecart a bit</li>\n\t<li>Break the powered rail underneath the minecart</li>\n\t<li>Break the block underneath the minecart</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p><b>Observed result</b>:<br>\nWhatever the minecart's x, z values were, it will snap onto the center of the rail.</p>\n\n<p><b>Expected result</b>:<br>\nThe minecart will keep its x, z values like in 1.21.1 and below.</p>\n\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"17/Aug/24 5:30 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/36956","id":"36956","filename